{"meta":{"ui":"expenses","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"I have four expenses from one report waiting for my approval: Delta Air Lines, Travel, Nov 3, $412.60; Blue Bottle Coffee, Meals, Nov 4, $18.40; Uber, Transport, Nov 5, $36.25 (no receipt attached); WeWork day pass, Office, Nov 6, $45.00. Show them in a card with merchant, category, date and amount, flag the one missing a receipt, and let me approve or reject each (changing my mind is fine). Show how many are approved (\"N of 4 approved\") and the approved total, and a Submit button; after I submit, the card says Submitted with the count and the total.","text":"state rows=[{\"id\":1,\"merchant\":\"Delta Air Lines\",\"category\":\"Travel\",\"date\":\"Nov 3\",\"amount\":412.60,\"receipt\":true,\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"id\":2,\"merchant\":\"Blue Bottle Coffee\",\"category\":\"Meals\",\"date\":\"Nov 4\",\"amount\":18.40,\"receipt\":true,\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"id\":3,\"merchant\":\"Uber\",\"category\":\"Transport\",\"date\":\"Nov 5\",\"amount\":36.25,\"receipt\":false,\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"id\":4,\"merchant\":\"WeWork day pass\",\"category\":\"Office\",\"date\":\"Nov 6\",\"amount\":45.00,\"receipt\":true,\"status\":\"pending\"}]\nstate submitted=false\nlet approved = filter(rows, r => r.status == \"approved\")\nlet approvedCount = length(approved)\nlet approvedTotal = sum(approved, r => r.amount)\nChatCard \"Expense report\" \"4 expenses awaiting approval\" icon:\"receipt_long\" status:\"Pending\" w:390\n  if !submitted\n    each r in rows\n      Column gap:6\n        Row between\n          Column gap:2\n            Text.strong \"{r.merchant}\"\n            Text.muted \"{r.category} · {r.date}\"\n          Text.strong \"{money(r.amount,\"$\",2)}\"\n        if !r.receipt\n          Callout \"No receipt attached\" \"Attach a receipt before approving this expense.\" tone:warn icon:\"warning_amber\"\n        Row gap:8\n          ChoiceChip \"Approve\" selected:{r.status == \"approved\"} -> rows=updateWhere(rows, x => x.id == r.id, x => with(x, \"status\", \"approved\"))\n          ChoiceChip \"Reject\" selected:{r.status == \"rejected\"} -> rows=updateWhere(rows, x => x.id == r.id, x => with(x, \"status\", \"rejected\"))\n    Text.muted \"{approvedCount} of 4 approved\"\n    TotalBar \"Approved total\" \"Excludes rejected expenses\" amount:{money(approvedTotal,\"$\",2)} cta:\"Submit\" enabled:{approvedCount > 0} -> submitted=true\n  if submitted\n    Receipt \"Submitted\" \"{approvedCount} approved expenses totalling {money(approvedTotal,\"$\",2)} were sent for payment.\" tone:good icon:\"check_circle\"","usage":{"input_tokens":9438,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":799,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":559,"totalMs":3181}}
